keiko 1
# K4 (an isolated read fault) — an unreadable credential file degrades to Not
# set with the safe warning line and no Notice, and the read deletes nothing.
# Excluded: the file's survival (it is the fixture the sandbox copied; the read
# never writes, and a kept-sandbox check proves it).
fault credential-unreadable
setting play.text_speed 0

activate title.settings
expect surface settings
expect control settings.key label "Not set Paste or type a NanoGPT key"
expect log warn row 24 contains "could not read the credential file"
expect notice none
